{"id":"tas","lemma":"tas","pos":"noun","rank":793,"glosses":["heap, pile, a great many","thing"],"ipa":"/ta/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d7/Fr-tas.ogg/Fr-tas.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"J'ai des tas d'amis.","en":"I have tons of friends.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"friend","l":"ami"}]},{"text":"Je connais des tas de blagues.","en":"I know tons of jokes.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"joke","l":"blague"}]},{"text":"Nous avons eu des tas de problèmes hier.","en":"We had a lot of problems yesterday.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"problem","l":"problème"},{"g":"yesterday"}]},{"text":"J'ai tout un tas d'idées.","en":"I have a whole lot of ideas.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"idea","l":"idée"}]},{"text":"J'ai un tas de choses à faire.","en":"I have loads of things to do.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"thing","l":"chose"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to do"}]}]}